sland’s narrow center."}],["$","span",null,{"className":"map-actions","children":["$undefined",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":["Map source ",["$","$Le",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$d:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:2:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-up-right","size":13}]]}]]}],["$","small",null,{"children":"Interactive map: drag to pan and use the +/− controls to zoom."}]]}]]}],["$","figure","Plan of the Battle of Roanoke Island",{"className":"reference-map","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"map-frame static-map-frame","children":["$","a",null,{"className":"map-image-link","href":"/projects/civil-war-field-companion/images/roanoke-island-battle-map.jpg","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","aria-label":"Open Plan of the Battle of Roanoke Island at full size","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/projects/civil-war-field-companion/images/roanoke-island-battle-map.jpg","alt":"Color wartime map of the Battle of Roanoke Island showing United States and Confederate positions, forts, roads, landing site, and troop movements","width":1600,"height":1200,"loading":"lazy"}]}]}],["$","figcaption",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Plan of the Battle of Roanoke Island"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Robert Knox Sneden’s wartime map shows the February 7 landing, the road, the swamp-flanked Confederate redoubt, the three United States brigade routes, and the forts and naval positions in Croatan Sound."}],["$","span",null,{"className":"map-actions","children":[["$","a",null,{"href":"/projects/civil-war-field-companion/images/roanoke-island-battle-map.jpg","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":["Open full-size map ",["$","$Le",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$d:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:2:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-up-right","size":13}]]}],["$","a",null,{"href"